Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.53,0:00:15.16,rules,sign,0,0,0,,Simply
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:15.76,rules2,sign,0,0,0,,Die
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.20,rules,sign,0,0,0,,Heart attack
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:57.94,name,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,1)}Yagami Light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.65,0:01:01.36,Main,manager,0,0,0,,Excuse us, please make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:02.12,Main,misa,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:05.53,name2,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(380,1)\pos(765,509)}Amane Misa
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:02.91,Main,crowd,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.91,0:01:04.36,Main,misa,0,0,0,,See you again, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.36,0:01:06.15,Main,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:08.24,Main,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.57,0:01:09.67,Main,crowd,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.79,0:01:12.87,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,Misa-Misa's damn cute, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:14.87,Main,light,0,0,0,,She really cheers you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:16.54,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,Want to grab a bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:18.24,Main,light,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:19.96,Main,light,0,0,0,,They're short-handed, \Nso they asked me to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:21.42,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:24.91,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,Then how about we eat at your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:27.31,Main,light,0,0,0,,Sure, but don't count on \Ngetting my employee discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.31,0:01:27.80,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,You figured me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.07,0:01:29.16,Main,light,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:33.77,pub,sign,0,0,0,,Pub Yonosuke
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:33.77,Main,mashima,0,0,0,,Yagami-kun, you want a public sector job?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:37.27,Main,light,0,0,0,,Well, job security. There's no risk \Nof them going out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.58,0:01:39.45,Main,mashima,0,0,0,,Don't you have any ambition?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.45,0:01:41.59,Main,mashima,0,0,0,,Like hitting it big and getting rich?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.35,0:01:44.28,Main,light,0,0,0,,Once you get greedy, there's no end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.90,0:01:48.58,Italics,light,0,0,0,,You can invest your life in something, \Nand it might make you money,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:50.86,Italics,light,0,0,0,,but it won't necessarily make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:54.56,Main,light,0,0,0,,If I get really desperate,\NI hope you'll give me a job here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:01:58.01,Main,mashima,0,0,0,,Desperate, huh? We have an employment \Nexam here, too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.01,0:01:58.83,Main,light,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.70,0:02:00.96,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,You could do it if you applied yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.55,0:02:04.72,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,You've always beaten me on grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:07.54,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,You could aim a bit higher \Nif you worked at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:10.41,Main,light,0,0,0,,No thanks. No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.41,0:02:11.46,Main,light,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:12.90,Main,mashima,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.90,0:02:14.74,Main,mashima,0,0,0,,He's so fast on register.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:16.69,Main,light,0,0,0,,You're praising me for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.69,0:02:18.68,Main,light,0,0,0,,As long as I can feed myself
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:19.78,Main,light,0,0,0,,{\a6}Well, I make it a point \Nnot to overexert myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:20.98,Main,light,0,0,0,,and spend my days in peace and \Nstability, that's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.98,0:02:22.35,Main,customer,0,0,0,,Check please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:23.11,Main,light,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:28.07,pub,sign,0,0,0,,Pub Yonosuke
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:30.52,Main,light,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:31.78,Main,mashima,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:35.05,Main,sako,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:38.33,Main,sako,0,0,0,,Hey, is that Kamoda I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:41.37,Main,sako,0,0,0,,It's me, Sakota!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.04,0:02:43.67,Main,sako,0,0,0,,And you're Yagami, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.38,0:02:46.09,Main,mashima,0,0,0,,You know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:50.63,Main,sako,0,0,0,,We were classmates in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.63,0:02:52.68,Main,mashima,0,0,0,,Oh, I see! Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.45,0:02:58.50,Main,light,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:02:59.19,Main,mashima,0,0,0,,How's it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.19,0:03:00.79,Main,sako,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:02.89,Main,mashima,0,0,0,,Hey, wait. Pour his beer for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.66,0:03:09.42,Main,sako,0,0,0,,I've been in a study abroad \Nprogram all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.42,0:03:11.34,Main,sako,0,0,0,,I ended up coming back sooner than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.63,0:03:13.41,Main,sako,0,0,0,,Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:16.90,Italics,light,0,0,0,,No, you were in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.91,0:03:20.10,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,Just hand it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:23.30,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,That sucks. This won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:24.42,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:30.01,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,What are you glaring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.45,0:03:31.19,Flashback,light,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.91,0:03:33.81,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:37.56,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,Next up is rich boy Kamoda. Come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:38.82,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:40.23,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.23,0:03:42.06,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:43.29,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:44.60,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:45.70,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,Three—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:48.75,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:50.64,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,I'll hold onto the Guinness application fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.64,0:03:52.78,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,Wow, you're loaded!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.85,0:03:58.70,Main,mashima,0,0,0,,Oh... it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.54,0:04:02.92,Main,sako,0,0,0,,I hope we can pick up where we left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:07.57,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,What do I do, Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:12.93,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,I... he's going to go back to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.53,0:04:34.20,Main,sako,0,0,0,,Kamoda. Bring 300,000 tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:37.30,Main,sako,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.23,0:04:45.27,Main,light,0,0,0,,Stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:56.35,Main,light,0,0,0,,Stop doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:07.27,Main,sako,0,0,0,,I never liked the way you looked at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.37,0:05:17.46,Main,light,0,0,0,,Give that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:22.37,Main,sako,0,0,0,,When Kamoda comes with the 300,000, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:31.12,Main,sako,0,0,0,,Let's have a nice, long acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.89,0:05:43.04,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,I wish guys like him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:47.98,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,would just go away forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.00,0:06:51.59,house,sign,0,0,0,,Yagami
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:52.41,Main,light,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.41,0:06:57.82,Main,light,0,0,0,,If you're not gonna watch it, turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.82,0:06:59.23,Main,light,0,0,0,,You're running up our electricity bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:02.14,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Hey, I {\i1}was{\i0} watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.14,0:07:03.14,Main,light,0,0,0,,Where's Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:05.08,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Staying at work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:07.73,name3,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,1)}Yagami Sayu
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.73,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.73,0:07:09.99,Main,light,0,0,0,,Cook for yourself for once. I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.99,0:07:10.95,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:18.61,Main,light,0,0,0,,Death... Death Note?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:23.07,Main,light,0,0,0,,"How to use it"...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:26.62,Main,light,0,0,0,,English?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:29.29,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Longman Japanese-English Dictionary
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:39.97,Italics,light,0,0,0,,The human whose name is written \Nin this note shall die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:42.27,Italics,light,0,0,0,,This note will not take effect unless \Nthe writer has the person's face
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:43.89,Italics,light,0,0,0,,in their mind when writing his or her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.22,0:07:47.72,Italics,light,0,0,0,,Therefore, people sharing the \Nsame name will not be affected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:50.31,Italics,light,0,0,0,,If the cause of death is \Nwritten within 40 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.31,0:07:53.23,Italics,light,0,0,0,,of writing the person's name, it will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:56.25,Italics,light,0,0,0,,If the cause of death is not specified, the \Nperson will simply die of a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:04.12,Main,light,0,0,0,,Utter nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:07.54,Main,light,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.29,0:08:13.92,Flashback,sako,0,0,0,,Let's have a nice, long acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:16.16,Flashback,kamo,0,0,0,,I wish guys like him would \Njust go away forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.20,0:08:45.45,notebook,sign,0,0,0,,Sakota Genbu
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:43.96,Main,light,0,0,0,,This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.47,0:09:57.05,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,My brother's?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:57.69,Main,cop,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:01.65,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Hey, bro. Do you know a guy called Sakota?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:03.33,Main,cop,0,0,0,,Yagami Light-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:04.00,Main,light,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:08.83,Main,cop,0,0,0,,We checked the contents of the phone \Nand we're pretty sure it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.45,0:10:11.95,Main,cop,0,0,0,,We found it in Sakota-san's jacket pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.95,0:10:13.50,Main,light,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:15.58,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,He said the guy died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:18.00,Main,light,0,0,0,,Died?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.55,0:10:19.72,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Oh, water's boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:23.00,Main,cop,0,0,0,,Last night around 11:30 he ran his \Nmotorcycle into a railroad crossing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:25.21,Main,cop,0,0,0,,while the gate was down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:26.63,Main,cop,0,0,0,,It seems he died instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:28.92,Main,cop,0,0,0,,Were the two of you acquainted?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:31.01,Main,cop,0,0,0,,Yagami-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:35.85,Main,light,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. Um... we were \Nclassmates in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.85,0:10:38.55,Main,light,0,0,0,,Er, but we never hung out much...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:40.77,Main,light,0,0,0,,Yesterday, we just happened to \Nrun into each other at my job...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:44.23,Main,light,0,0,0,,I must have dropped it and \Nhe picked it up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:46.72,Main,cop,0,0,0,,I see! Well, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:47.99,Main,light,0,0,0,,Thank you for your trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:11.58,Italics,light,0,0,0,,The human whose name is written \Nin this note shall die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.58,0:11:14.20,Italics,light,0,0,0,,If the cause of death is not specified, the \Nperson will simply die of a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.86,0:11:22.28,Main,light,0,0,0,,But he died in an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:25.77,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Hey, where's breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:27.26,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:29.10,Main,light,0,0,0,,Right. I'll make it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.53,0:11:31.19,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,I'll have toast today. Toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:46.46,wake,sign,0,0,0,,Site of the Late Genbu \NSakota's Funeral and Wake
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:55.59,Main,boy,0,0,0,,Scared the hell out of me yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:12:00.45,Main,boy,0,0,0,,The way Sakota was just riding along \Nand suddenly doubled over in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:09.05,Flashback,boy,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:10.63,Flashback,boy,0,0,0,,Hey! Sakota!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.30,0:12:16.87,Main,boy,0,0,0,,Then he splatted right into that train.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.95,0:12:19.50,Main,boy,0,0,0,,What the hell was that, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:21.21,Main,boy,0,0,0,,A heart attack, they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.21,0:12:21.78,Main,boy,0,0,0,,Heart attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.78,0:12:22.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.07,0:12:37.75,Main,light,0,0,0,,N-No... no...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:42.26,Main,light,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:45.18,Main,light,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.03,0:12:49.38,Main,light,0,0,0,,No way... No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.30,0:12:53.73,Main,boy,0,0,0,,Look at you, grinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:56.03,Main,boy,0,0,0,,We're at a wake, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.03,0:12:57.40,Main,boy,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.40,0:12:58.64,Main,boy,0,0,0,,Just between us,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:02.08,Main,boy,0,0,0,,Sakota did nothing but make trouble \Nfor people when he was alive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:03.75,Main,boy,0,0,0,,Look at these posts from \Nhis graduating class.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.75,0:13:07.20,Main,boy,0,0,0,,Deep down, they're all relieved he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.79,0:13:08.94,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Take that, Sakota! lololololol
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.79,0:13:08.94,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuki, that's so rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:09.34,Main,boy,0,0,0,,"Take that, Sakota"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:11.01,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,A lot of people hated school because of him.\NDying's the nicest thing he ever did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:11.01,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Seriously. He scared me so I did \Neverything I could to avoid him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.34,0:13:11.01,Main,boy,0,0,0,,"Dying's the nicest thing he ever did."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:12.96,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Scum of the earth = Sakota
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:12.96,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Sakota had no value alive anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:14.25,Main,boy,0,0,0,,"Sakota had no value alive anyway."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:21.85,Italics,light,0,0,0,,Yesterday, a man died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.91,0:13:27.02,Italics,light,0,0,0,,But a lot of people aren't sad.\NThey're actually happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:33.33,HQ,sign,0,0,0,,Taxi Driver Robbery & Murder\NCase Investigation Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.80,0:13:33.90,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,Regarding the suspect who fled the scene
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.90,0:13:36.30,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,after killing a taxi driver and \Nstealing his fares this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:40.74,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,an image from the taxi's on-board camera \Nhas confirmed it to be Otoharada Kuro,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.94,0:13:40.74,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Wanted\NFor robbery and murder\NOtoharada Kuro
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.74,0:13:42.44,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,age 46, who was released \Non parole a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:44.48,name,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)}Yagami Soichiro\N{\fs29.348}Metropolitan Police Department Criminal Investigation Bureau\N1st Division Chief Inspector
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:46.98,Main,aisawa,0,0,0,,The house his guarantor set up for \Nhim after parole was found empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:49.58,Main,aizawa,0,0,0,,We're putting up wanted posters and \Nwe're trying to find where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.58,0:13:50.35,Main,aizawa,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:55.06,name3,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)}Mogi Kanzo\N{\fs29.348}Metropolitan Police Department Criminal Investigation Bureau\N1st Division Assistant Inspector
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:55.06,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,So Otoharada's out, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:59.39,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,I want to see a thorough investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.39,0:14:01.40,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.16,0:14:05.03,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,Yagami-kun, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:06.63,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.07,0:14:08.44,Main,kogizo,0,0,0,,Okay, dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:09.60,Main,all,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:16.04,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Chief... This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:18.21,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Work with local authorities \Nin the investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:22.52,name4,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)}Matsuda Tota     Aizawa Shuichi\N{\fs29.348}1st Division Officer        1st Division Sergeant\N{\fs21.522}Metropolitan Police Department Criminal Investigation Bureau
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.21,0:14:19.81,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,I want a full report of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:22.52,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Yes sir. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:25.09,Main,aisawa,0,0,0,,That damned Ogiso,\Nthrowing his weight around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.52,0:14:27.72,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Now, now. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:29.79,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,The Chief is enduring it just like we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:32.46,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened between the \NChief and the suspect, Otoharada?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:33.96,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,You hadn't heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:38.07,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Ten years ago, Otoharada got hopped up \Non meth and went on a killing spree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.07,0:14:40.23,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,It was Chief who caught him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.83,0:14:46.21,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,The two of us wore through ten pairs of \Nshoes between us at the height of summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.21,0:14:47.51,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,That must have cost a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.51,0:14:49.18,Main,aisawa,0,0,0,,Matsuda! That's not what he's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.18,0:14:50.01,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,No, I'm sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.01,0:14:52.55,Main,aisawa,0,0,0,,No! It's not about money, he's talking \Nabout doing a lot of footwork!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.55,0:14:54.31,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,But you can't do anything without money!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:58.35,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,That was one expensive summer...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.96,0:15:08.63,Flashback,cop,0,0,0,,Yagami-san! You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:09.60,Flashback,cop,0,0,0,,Great work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:11.30,Flashback,soichi,0,0,0,,Take Otoharada to the interrogation room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.30,0:15:12.17,Flashback,both,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:17.60,Flashback,otohara,0,0,0,,Just you wait... I'll kill you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:18.54,Flashback,cop,0,0,0,,Shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:21.14,Flashback,otohara,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill the hell \Nout of you! Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.14,0:15:23.58,Flashback,otohara,0,0,0,,You hear me? I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:23.08,Flashback,cop,0,0,0,,Yagami-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:28.42,Flashback,cop,0,0,0,,We got a call from the hospital. \NYour wife's in critical condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.02,0:15:34.09,Flashback,mogi,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to us.\NGo to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:37.69,Flashback,soichi,0,0,0,,No, Otoharada takes priority. \NI'll go to the hospital later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.14,0:15:54.27,Flashback,light,0,0,0,,Why didn't you come right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:02.02,Flashback,light,0,0,0,,I called and I called!\NWhy didn't you come right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.89,0:16:10.79,Flashback,sayu,0,0,0,,Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:20.87,Flashback,sayu,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:21.70,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.70,0:16:22.40,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.40,0:16:23.74,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Hey, you had dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.01,0:16:28.44,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Dad, you want a beer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:30.68,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,I got it cold for you and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.35,0:16:32.55,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,This is a shake-down for allowance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:34.25,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Come on! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.15,0:16:36.45,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Should I peel you an apple?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.45,0:16:37.55,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.02,0:16:39.99,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Then I'll fetch you a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.43,0:16:49.40,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:58.17,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:16:59.27,Main,light,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.38,0:17:04.34,Main,light,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:07.78,Main,light,0,0,0,,You almost never come up to my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:13.39,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Making progress with your \Npublic service exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.36,0:17:16.56,Main,light,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.16,0:17:19.29,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:25.47,Main,light,0,0,0,,I'm hoping to get into the local ward office.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.57,0:17:28.74,Main,light,0,0,0,,Even if that's wrong, I don't \Nplan to join the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.51,0:17:33.04,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,I guess you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:38.08,Main,light,0,0,0,,Oh, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.75,0:17:43.15,Main,light,0,0,0,,Murder...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.85,0:17:50.76,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,What's this all of a sudden? \NWhat about murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:59.30,Main,light,0,0,0,,Those cases never stop, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:03.04,Main,light,0,0,0,,No matter how much you suffer for it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.01,0:18:12.25,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,I might be working long shifts for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.61,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Take care of things here at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.87,0:18:41.61,Main,cop,0,0,0,,Hey, you. What are you doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:54.52,Main,csi,0,0,0,,We found a fare envelope from a taxi company
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:56.69,Main,csi,0,0,0,,and a knife thought to be \Nthe weapon used next to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.69,0:18:57.59,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Where's the officer's gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.59,0:18:58.43,Main,csi,0,0,0,,It's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.73,0:19:01.76,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,This is unfolding in the worst possible way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:02.60,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,Mogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.43,0:19:05.03,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,A man carrying what looked like a handgun
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.03,0:19:06.60,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,has holed himself up in a \Nprivate residence in Meguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.83,0:19:08.17,Main,aizawa,0,0,0,,This sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.80,0:19:10.94,Main,light,0,0,0,,You can't kill someone \Nwith something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:17.98,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.98,0:19:18.41,Main,light,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.41,0:19:20.18,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Hey, when did Dad head out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:20.91,Main,light,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.72,0:19:23.82,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,I missed my chance to get allowance from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.59,0:19:27.96,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Hey, did you eat the apples over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.96,0:19:29.72,Main,light,0,0,0,,Didn't Dad eat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:30.66,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,All three?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.53,0:19:33.13,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:41.50,Main,cop,0,0,0,,Take your positions!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:44.57,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Otoharada Kuro, give yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.21,0:19:47.07,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,We have you surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.51,0:19:48.81,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Give yourself up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:51.48,Main,otohara,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.18,0:19:55.15,Main,otohara,0,0,0,,I'll freaking kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:01.05,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Ah, heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:03.22,Main,aizawa,0,0,0,,That son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.99,0:20:05.69,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:08.60,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,How many hostages?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:09.56,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:12.43,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,A housewife and her daughter \Nin elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.43,0:20:13.37,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Elementary school?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:15.87,Main,aisawa,0,0,0,,The longer we wait, the greater the \Nrisk to those hostages becomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.87,0:20:18.14,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,We should call the superintendent and \Nstorm the place as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:18.81,Main,cop,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.81,0:20:19.94,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.31,0:20:29.15,Main,neighbor,0,0,0,,Today's non-combustible trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.78,0:20:31.65,Main,light,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:38.26,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,1st Division, Matsuda-san\NCall incoming
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:44.23,Main,light,0,0,0,,Matsuda-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:46.87,Main,light,0,0,0,,Why did Dad make himself a hostage?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:50.30,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,The chief made a deal with the suspect in \Nexchange for an elementary school girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.30,0:20:51.14,Main,light,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:52.71,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,What the hell does Yagami think he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:55.74,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,If there's one thing\NI hate, it's grandstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.74,0:20:58.75,Main,guy,0,0,0,,{\a6}I'm sorry, sir. \NWe're evaluating the situation now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.31,0:21:00.48,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,The Chief has a history with the \Nman holed up in that building.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:02.72,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,Apparently it was Chief \NYagami who arrested him,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:04.75,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,back around the time your mother passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:06.15,Main,light,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.15,0:21:09.29,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,It's like he feels responsible for his \Ngetting parole and committing crimes again—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.29,0:21:10.09,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,Matsuda!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.09,0:21:10.49,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.49,0:21:11.46,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,What are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.46,0:21:12.56,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,Return to the scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:12.93,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.19,0:21:15.86,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,Sayu's in there. Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.44,0:21:24.27,Main,light,0,0,0,,Sayu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.34,0:21:26.11,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:29.34,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Dad's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.35,0:21:32.51,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Dad's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:41.12,Main,cop,0,0,0,,Coming through! Clear the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.79,0:21:42.59,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,How's the Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.52,0:21:46.29,Main,aisawa,0,0,0,,It's not looking good, Mr. Mogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:54.20,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Otoharada.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.37,0:21:57.27,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,You remember me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.41,0:22:01.41,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,You should be well aware \Nthat this is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.61,0:22:04.41,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Just give up and turn yourself in already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.42,0:22:14.19,Main,otohara,0,0,0,,Why do you think I traded that kid for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:17.66,Main,otohara,0,0,0,,You're the one that "should be well aware."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:21.76,Flashback,otohara,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill the hell \Nout of you! Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.76,0:22:23.83,Main,otohara,0,0,0,,I made a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.97,0:22:30.04,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Live - Spree Killing Suspect \NHoled Up with Hostages
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.27,0:22:30.27,Main,ann,0,0,0,,The man holed up in the residence in broad \Ndaylight, according to police investigations,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.04,0:22:31.97,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Live - Spree Killing Suspect Holed Up with Hostages\NSuspect: Otoharada Kuro (46)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.27,0:22:33.21,Main,ann,0,0,0,,is Otoharada Kuro, age 46.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.01,0:22:38.75,Main,ann,0,0,0,,{\a6}Early on the 20th, Otoharada allegedly \Nstabbed a taxi driver to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.74,0:22:37.28,Main,light,0,0,0,,Otoharada...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.75,0:22:43.65,Main,ann,0,0,0,,{\a6}took his fare money and fled...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.68,0:22:40.78,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.65,0:22:46.89,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Just kill that scum and save my dad already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.69,0:22:49.29,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Just kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.89,0:22:54.19,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Kill him already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.40,0:22:58.40,Main,light,0,0,0,,Sayu...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.11,0:23:06.41,TV,sign,0,0,0,,Otoharada Kuro
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.71,0:23:15.75,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,If you fire, the special forces out \Nthere are going to storm the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.62,0:23:19.89,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,If they do, I can't protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.89,0:23:21.79,Main,otohara,0,0,0,,You wouldn't anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.82,0:23:25.49,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Even if you're a criminal, I want \Nto save all the lives I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.53,0:23:29.33,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Don't throw your life away, Otoharada.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.33,0:23:32.20,Main,otohara,0,0,0,,Shut up. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.95,0:23:48.12,Main,ann,0,0,0,,{\a6}The atmosphere is tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.12,0:23:50.45,Main,ann,0,0,0,,{\a6}The suspect has a handgun,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:54.12,Main,ann,0,0,0,,{\a6}making it difficult for SWAT\Nto storm the residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.12,0:23:56.26,Italics,light,0,0,0,,The human whose name is written \Nin this note shall die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.79,0:23:58.26,Italics,light,0,0,0,,If the cause of death is written within
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.26,0:24:00.70,Italics,light,0,0,0,,40 seconds of writing the \Nperson's name, it will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.70,0:24:03.40,Italics,light,0,0,0,,If the cause of death is not specified, the \Nperson will simply die of a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.87,0:24:07.44,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Live - Spree Killing Suspect \NHoled Up with Hostages
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.27,0:24:09.90,Main,ann,0,0,0,,The suspect, Otoharada, holed up in \Nthe house earlier with his hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.44,0:24:09.90,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Live - Spree Killing Suspect Holed Up with Hostages\N Suspect: Otoharada Kuro (46)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.47,0:24:15.68,Main,ann,0,0,0,,{\a6}I repeat. The suspect is \NOtoharada Kuro, age 46.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.11,0:24:14.91,Main,light,0,0,0,,Otoharada... Kuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.14,0:24:18.71,Main,otohara,0,0,0,,Then we'll go out together!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.46,0:24:33.56,Main,light,0,0,0,,Death Note...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:38.83,Main,light,0,0,0,,If you're the real thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.30,0:24:42.10,Main,light,0,0,0,,Then kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.51,0:24:56.05,notebook2,sign,0,0,0,,Otoharada Kuro
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.03,0:25:04.73,Main,light,0,0,0,,Ten...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.87,0:25:11.63,Main,light,0,0,0,,Twenty...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.54,0:25:16.70,Main,light,0,0,0,,Thirty...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.67,0:25:20.78,Main,otohara,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.64,0:25:22.74,Main,light,0,0,0,,Forty!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.01,0:25:29.18,Main,ann,0,0,0,,...is in there with a man with a gun. \NIt's a mentally taxing situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.41,0:25:26.41,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Live - Spree Killing Suspect \NHoled Up with Hostages
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.25,0:25:28.58,Main,light,0,0,0,,Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.18,0:25:32.25,Main,ann,0,0,0,,With great concern for the \Nsafety of the two hostages...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.55,0:25:31.69,Main,light,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.69,0:25:34.29,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Live - Spree killing suspect \Nholed up with hostages
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.62,0:25:36.72,Main,ann,0,0,0,,We've heard a gunshot! We heard what sounded \Nlike a gunshot coming from the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.72,0:25:37.66,Main,aisawa,0,0,0,,Mogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.66,0:25:39.03,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Storm the place! Storm the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.00,0:25:45.60,Main,ann,0,0,0,,Moments ago, we heard what sounded \Nlike a gunshot coming from the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.60,0:25:47.60,Main,ann,0,0,0,,and the SWAT team stormed the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.73,0:25:52.27,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Live - Spree Killing Suspect \NHoled Up with Hostages
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.20,0:25:51.57,Main,ann,0,0,0,,It looks like they're \Nbringing the hostages out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.57,0:25:53.07,Main,ann,0,0,0,,The hostages are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.07,0:25:58.75,Main,ann,0,0,0,,A 36 year old woman who lived in the house, \Nand the police officer who went inside
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.75,0:26:01.55,Main,ann,0,0,0,,both appear to be evacuated safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.09,0:26:05.19,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,Chief, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.19,0:26:05.59,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.89,0:26:06.55,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.09,0:26:10.39,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Chief. What was that gunshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.09,0:26:12.16,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,An accidental discharge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.76,0:26:14.63,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Otoharada suddenly staggered in pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.63,0:26:16.53,Flashback,otohara,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.34,0:26:28.01,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,What, like a heart attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.01,0:26:28.88,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.08,0:26:33.75,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Live - Spree Killing Suspect \NHoled Up with Hostages
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.51,0:26:33.75,Main,ann,0,0,0,,It appears the perpetrator \Ndied inside the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.75,0:26:37.45,Main,ann,0,0,0,,The shot was not fired by \Nthe hostage police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.45,0:26:42.72,Main,ann,0,0,0,,It happened when the perpetrator suddenly \Ndoubled over in pain and collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.42,0:26:45.93,Main,ann,0,0,0,,I repeat. The perpetrator...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.53,0:26:49.00,notebook3,sign,0,0,0,,Otoharada Kuro
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.67,0:26:51.73,Main,light,0,0,0,,It really is...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.27,0:26:56.91,Main,light,0,0,0,,the real thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.08,0:27:03.01,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.01,0:27:08.45,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Is Light here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.82,0:27:10.99,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,He ran off somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.99,0:27:12.79,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Really, he's so unreliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.63,0:27:19.09,Italics,light,0,0,0,,How could this have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.13,0:27:22.10,notebook,sign,0,0,0,,Otoharada Kuro
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.70,0:27:28.17,Italics,light,0,0,0,,I would have been happy... just \Nletting the days pass uneventfully...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.64,0:27:36.44,Main,light,0,0,0,,I killed...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.88,0:27:41.78,Main,light,0,0,0,,two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.62,0:27:45.42,Main,light,0,0,0,,I killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.02,0:27:54.30,notebook,sign,0,0,0,,Otoharada Kuro
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.10,0:27:57.90,Main,light,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.17,0:28:02.97,Main,light,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.78,0:28:09.34,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Feel like dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.75,0:28:21.56,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,I'm the one who dropped that Death Note.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.56,0:28:24.53,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,The Shinigami, Ryuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.03,0:28:33.20,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,No need to act so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.20,0:28:39.97,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,You already realized it's no \Nordinary notebook, didn't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.41,0:28:49.18,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,How's it feel to do someone in?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.80,0:29:39.07,Main,light,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.79,0:30:01.59,Main,light,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.43,0:30:06.23,Main,light,0,0,0,,Sayu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.43,0:30:11.70,Main,light,0,0,0,,This is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.51,0:30:20.78,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,You don't want the Death Note, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.56,0:30:46.17,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Just because you're possessed by a shinigami, \Nthat's no reason to hurry to your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.84,0:30:56.91,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Yagami Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.66,0:31:11.26,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Shinigami don't steal souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.26,0:31:15.43,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,That's an idea you humans \Ndreamed up for yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.20,0:31:19.13,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,That notebook became the \Nproperty of the human world
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.13,0:31:22.47,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,the minute it touched the \Nground of the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.47,0:31:26.31,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,In other words, it belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.08,0:31:29.21,Main,light,0,0,0,,I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.25,0:31:33.68,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.68,0:31:35.15,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.85,0:31:40.26,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Just write the name of any \Nhuman you want gone inside it,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.26,0:31:42.79,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,and you can erase them from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.79,0:31:48.03,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,If you use it the right way, you \Ncould become a very rich man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.03,0:31:57.04,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,But if you still don't want it, \NI'll erase all your memories of the notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.61,0:31:58.81,Main,light,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.11,0:32:03.48,Main,light,0,0,0,,th-that notebook...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.72,0:32:10.18,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.18,0:32:12.55,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,What if a real bastard like \Nthose guys you killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.55,0:32:16.22,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Otoharada or Sakota, \Npicked up that notebook?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.63,0:32:19.99,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Things could get pretty interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.20,0:32:22.30,Main,light,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.93,0:32:28.84,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,The person who picks up the Death \NNote gets to decide how they use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.54,0:32:32.17,Main,light,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.21,0:32:38.18,Main,light,0,0,0,,I-In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.15,0:32:43.62,Main,light,0,0,0,,Wh-what does it cost to use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.22,0:32:52.99,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,I think you already got a taste of the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.97,0:33:04.07,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,An agony and terror that only \Nthe one who holds it can feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.01,0:33:09.64,Flashback,light,0,0,0,,I killed... two people...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.85,0:33:14.98,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Any human who uses the Death Note
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.59,0:33:21.89,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,can't expect to get to go to Heaven or Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.93,0:33:24.86,Main,light,0,0,0,,Wh-Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.86,0:33:28.70,Main,light,0,0,0,,did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.56,0:33:33.64,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Being a shinigami is awfully boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.30,0:33:42.08,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,We live so long, we run out of things to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.08,0:33:43.34,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.38,0:33:49.18,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,I wanted to see what would happen \Nif a human started using it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.18,0:33:53.76,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,The deepest depths of human desire!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.86,0:34:01.76,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Yagami Light, what is it you desire?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.97,0:34:04.83,Main,light,0,0,0,,Desire...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.40,0:34:14.34,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Well, you can decide for \Nyourself what you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.67,0:34:44.57,LATER,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400))}One Month Later, England
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.04,0:35:15.84,Main,watari,0,0,0,,What shall we do, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.24,0:35:20.71,Main,L,0,0,0,,Watari. Let's go to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.61,0:35:23.34,Main,watari,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.75,0:35:28.88,Main,watari,0,0,0,,but the Japanese police haven't asked for \Nour assistance in their investigation yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.35,0:35:34.69,Main,L,0,0,0,,Then get them to ask for our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.12,0:35:38.19,Main,watari,0,0,0,,Such a willful young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.44,0:35:55.14,LATER,sign,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs58.696\fad(1,480)}Tokyo
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.82,0:36:03.12,notebook-general,sign,0,0,0,,Kabeoka Hitoshi
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.42,0:36:05.69,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,It's the body of Hitoshi \NKabeoka, 40 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.69,0:36:08.72,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,He's wanted all over the country \Non suspicion of murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.16,0:36:12.59,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,We won't know the precise cause of \Ndeath until after the autopsy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.59,0:36:15.83,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,It's going to be heart failure \Nor a heart attack, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.26,0:36:17.63,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,Looking that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.63,0:36:20.64,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Another one. That's 52 we \Nknow of in just one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.34,0:36:26.47,notebook-general,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.47,0:36:28.38,Main,aisawa,0,0,0,,This is the 53rd.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.01,0:36:31.65,Main,aisawa,0,0,0,,And every single one of \Nthem from heart attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.11,0:36:33.41,Main,aisawa,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.85,0:36:36.12,notebook-general,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.12,0:36:38.09,notebook-general,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.49,0:36:47.03,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,For the past month, similar mysterious \Ndeaths have been occurring not just in Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.56,0:36:47.39,HQ,sign,0,0,0,,Heinous Criminal Serial Murder Case \NSpecial Investigation Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.03,0:36:48.63,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,but all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.39,0:36:48.63,newspapers,sign,0,0,0,,String of mysterious deaths of heinous criminals\N Another criminal dies of heart attack
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.63,0:36:50.66,newspapers,sign,0,0,0,,{\an4}Body of man\Nfound in city park\NShows linked to\Nstring of heinous\Ncriminal deaths
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.63,0:36:50.66,newspapers,sign,0,0,0,,Mysterious deaths occurring worldwide\NShows connections to unexplained deaths occurring in Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.63,0:36:50.66,newspapers,sign,0,0,0,,{\an6}Mysterious deaths\Nfound abroad too\NHeart attack again\NCause of death unclear
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.23,0:36:54.30,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,At first we considered that it could \Nbe a virus or a mass neurosis,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.30,0:36:59.77,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,but ICPO analysis denies that claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.67,0:37:01.31,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,Yagami-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.31,0:37:08.41,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,It's worth mentioning that the \Nvictims are all limited to
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.41,0:37:13.02,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,people convicted of crimes \Nclassified as "heinous."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.02,0:37:14.29,Main,furu,0,0,0,,How are they being killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.85,0:37:15.82,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,We don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.76,0:37:20.89,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,There are no external injuries, and the \Ncause of death in all cases is "heart attack."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.49,0:37:23.10,notebook-general,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.20,0:37:31.47,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Getting an early start to the day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.54,0:37:36.35,Main,light,0,0,0,,Ryuk... Don't scare me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.08,0:37:38.95,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Get used to it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.75,0:37:42.18,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Well? Who are today's candidates?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.99,0:37:44.25,Main,light,0,0,0,,Five men.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.32,0:37:45.32,Main,light,0,0,0,,Perpetrators of heinous crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.32,0:37:47.59,Main,light,0,0,0,,Their names and faces were announced \Non the news this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.39,0:37:51.29,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.26,0:37:54.63,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.63,0:37:57.37,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you not to wash my underwear?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.04,0:38:01.10,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.61,0:38:05.87,Main,light,0,0,0,,Then... wash it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.87,0:38:08.54,Main,light,0,0,0,,And knock before you come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.54,0:38:09.55,Main,light,0,0,0,,I'm studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.35,0:38:12.82,Main,sayu,0,0,0,,Who studies this early in the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.08,0:38:17.02,Main,light,0,0,0,,She really can't see you, can she?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.32,0:38:21.52,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Isn't that interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.33,0:38:28.60,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Only the person who touches the \NDeath Note can see me or hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.60,0:38:32.64,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Of course, if she touched the notebook,\Nit would all be over anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.17,0:38:34.80,Main,light,0,0,0,,If that happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.24,0:38:38.67,Main,light,0,0,0,,she wouldn't die of a heart attack, \Nshe'd die of shock from seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.41,0:38:40.98,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.98,0:38:43.31,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Hey, I beg your pardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.81,0:38:45.92,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,We've discovered something \Nin the way of a motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.55,0:38:47.62,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.28,0:38:48.88,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Himura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.42,0:38:53.02,Main,himura,0,0,0,,Himura Shoko, from 2nd Criminal \NInvestigation Support Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.32,0:38:54.76,name3,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)}Himura Shoko\N{\fs29.348}Metropolitan Police Department Criminal Investigation Bureau Support and Analysis Center
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.02,0:38:54.76,Main,himura,0,0,0,,Please look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.49,0:39:02.23,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,You're pretty good for a guy \Nwith such an innocent face.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.27,0:39:05.17,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.27,0:39:10.17,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,how does this benefit you, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.91,0:39:13.01,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Can it make you rich?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.84,0:39:17.61,Main,light,0,0,0,,It doesn't benefit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.85,0:39:20.12,Main,light,0,0,0,,I'm doing this for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.75,0:39:25.05,Main,light,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.19,0:39:30.09,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,What have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.09,0:39:33.36,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,The Legend of Kira, Our Savior
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.19,0:39:32.80,Main,light,0,0,0,,This is the voice of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.36,0:39:35.50,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,The Legend of Kira, Our Savior
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.33,0:39:35.50,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.83,0:39:38.30,Main,himura,0,0,0,,It's a nickname, derived \Nfrom the word "Killer."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.50,0:39:41.20,Main,himura,0,0,0,,There's a number of other similar fan sites.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.64,0:39:44.14,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,It's only been announced in the media as
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.14,0:39:46.24,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,"a string of mysterious deaths \Namong heinous criminals,"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.24,0:39:49.31,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,but the people are realizing there's \Na mastermind behind the killings,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.31,0:39:53.98,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,"judging the wicked from the shadows."\NSome are even lauding him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.62,0:40:02.16,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Keep it up, Kira!\N Please purge the wicked!\N Thank you for killing those criminals, Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.16,0:40:04.06,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,You're calling this a \Nmotive for the killings?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.63,0:40:06.03,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,We have no conclusive evidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.93,0:40:11.73,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,but we think our mastermind is after...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.33,0:40:14.97,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Keep it up, Kira!\N Please purge the wicked!\N Thank you for killing those criminals, Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.10,0:40:18.64,Main,light,0,0,0,,If I eliminate the criminals, people \Ncan live their lives without fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.98,0:40:21.38,Main,light,0,0,0,,I'm creating a peaceful world.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.58,0:40:24.28,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.28,0:40:26.22,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Are we witnessing the birth of a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.72,0:40:28.98,Main,light,0,0,0,,I'm not a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.98,0:40:30.95,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Hey, I want your autograph!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.95,0:40:33.66,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Write "To my friend Ryuk" right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.66,0:40:36.23,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Write it! Write it! Write it! Write it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.70,0:40:43.40,Main,light,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.90,0:40:46.87,Main,light,0,0,0,,Ryuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.07,0:40:51.94,Main,light,0,0,0,,How many people have I killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.41,0:40:54.84,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Fifty?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.84,0:40:57.81,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,No... 51?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.81,0:41:01.48,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,No, no, no... 52?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.92,0:41:06.99,Main,light,0,0,0,,I can't go back now, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.56,0:41:13.36,Main,light,0,0,0,,And I don't intend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.40,0:41:20.30,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,I'd say the perpetrator's motive \Nis a twisted sense of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.30,0:41:24.31,Main,goda,0,0,0,,Yes. I find a certain logic \Nin your speculation, Yagami-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.31,0:41:27.31,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. I was just thinking that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.68,0:41:28.74,Main,aisawa,0,0,0,,You liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.48,0:41:33.32,Main,clerk,0,0,0,,Excuse me. I've brought Watari-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.65,0:41:36.25,Main,goda,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.79,0:41:40.02,Main,goda,0,0,0,,I've brought in an outside consultant.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.02,0:41:42.79,Main,goda,0,0,0,,He's been investigating similar incidents \Noccurring in England and America
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.79,0:41:43.89,Main,goda,0,0,0,,at the request of the ICPO.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.29,0:41:47.06,Main,watari,0,0,0,,My name is Watari.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.86,0:41:51.23,Main,watari,0,0,0,,I will be aiding you in this investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.93,0:41:55.40,name5,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)}Watari\N{\fs29.348}L's Proxy
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.70,0:41:55.40,Main,watari,0,0,0,,I serve as L's proxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.21,0:41:57.17,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,"El"?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.94,0:41:59.44,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,It's something like a nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.01,0:42:03.21,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,Despite being a famous person who's \Nsolved numerous unsolved cases,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.21,0:42:06.22,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,Mr. L prefers to be cautious and \Nnot reveal his real name, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.18,0:42:08.75,Main,watari,0,0,0,,I request your understanding in this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.16,0:42:18.39,Main,light,0,0,0,,I'm going to create a peaceful world.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.43,0:42:21.83,Main,light,0,0,0,,A world with no criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.34,0:42:29.91,Main,light,0,0,0,,Kira can change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.81,0:42:39.32,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Humans are so interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.58,0:42:42.79,Main,girl,0,0,0,,You know about Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.79,0:42:44.05,Main,girl,0,0,0,,What do you think he's like?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.05,0:42:45.02,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Kira is God!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.05,0:42:45.85,Main,boy,0,0,0,,He's just a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.02,0:42:46.26,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,The Legend of Kira, Our Savior
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.85,0:42:47.89,Main,boy,0,0,0,,You're wrong. Kira is God.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.89,0:42:49.29,Main,boy,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's definitely God.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.22,0:42:49.86,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,I'm bored. Anything interesting going on?\N You know about Kira?\N Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.29,0:42:49.86,Main,girl,0,0,0,,He must be God!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.86,0:42:51.23,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs31.304}I'm bored. Anything interesting going on?\N You know about Kira?\N Who's that?\NYou know about the unexplained deaths of heinous criminals lately? \NYeah, I do! \NThey say it's because someone's bringing divine punishment down on them! \NThat's Kira. There's a website too. \NWhat the hell lol \Nthat's great lol \NI wonder if it's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.13,0:42:52.06,Main,boy,0,0,0,,He's no god. He's just a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.23,0:42:52.96,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs31.304}Yeah, I do!\N They say it's because someone's bringing divine punishment down on them!\N That's Kira. There's a website, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.13,0:42:56.60,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,What kind of person is Kira?\N I want to meet Kira-sama!\N Does this so-called Kira really exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.60,0:42:58.33,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Kira does exist. No, God is Kira. \NHe's begun his judgment of the wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.33,0:42:59.54,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Kira Post Summary\N If you list all the laws your precious Kira's broken,\Nit gets pretty amazing, lolol\N Points in common between unexplained deaths!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.54,0:43:00.97,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,More incidents of Kira cleaning up the scum of the earth\N The truth behind the string of unexplained criminal deaths - Kira the God is issuing his judgment
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.97,0:43:04.74,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Anonymous Kira Supporter\NWrong, Kira is God.\N\N Anonymous Kira Supporter\NI love Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.25,0:43:16.59,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,The Legend of Kira, Our Savior
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.46,0:43:27.23,Main,watari,0,0,0,,The police say they'll give \Nus their full cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.70,0:43:31.90,Main,L,0,0,0,,I see. Then take care of this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.87,0:43:39.88,Main,watari,0,0,0,,Another willful request.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.94,0:43:44.48,univ,sign,0,0,0,,Suginami University of Economics
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.05,0:43:50.45,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,Hey, Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.45,0:43:51.69,Main,light,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.69,0:43:53.79,Main,hira,0,0,0,,Hey sorry, but could I borrow your notebook?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.76,0:43:54.93,Main,light,0,0,0,,Huh? Notebook?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.13,0:43:59.10,Main,hira,0,0,0,,Yeah, I had an interview with a \Ncompany and I missed the lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.10,0:44:00.43,Main,hira,0,0,0,,I was hoping you'd let me look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.30,0:44:04.07,Main,light,0,0,0,,Oh, my class notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.07,0:44:05.04,Main,light,0,0,0,,Sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.64,0:44:08.41,Main,chi,0,0,0,,Hey, Yagami-kun. What do you think of Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.21,0:44:11.04,Main,light,0,0,0,,Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.31,0:44:13.38,Main,chi,0,0,0,,You think he's a murderer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.41,0:44:18.95,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,No, he's God, cleaning the world of scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.95,0:44:21.85,Main,chi,0,0,0,,Yagami-kun doesn't approve of \Ncommitting crimes. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.45,0:44:25.09,Main,light,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.02,0:44:30.79,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,What would you do if Misa-Misa was pro-Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.63,0:44:32.36,Main,light,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.36,0:44:34.43,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,See, I didn't know this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.86,0:44:38.07,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,It turns out Misa-Misa's family \Nwas killed a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.80,0:44:43.04,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,Misa-Misa's got a lot on \Nher shoulders too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.18,0:44:47.34,public,sign,0,0,0,,Public Prosecutors Office
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.34,0:44:48.85,type,sign,0,0,0,,Notice of Parole
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.85,0:44:51.41,type,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs48.913}Inmate Nishida Kyu
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.09,0:44:56.55,Main,misa,0,0,0,,Parole?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.25,0:45:02.59,Main,mikami,0,0,0,,At the hearing, the parole board \Nchose to allow Nishida's parole.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.62,0:45:02.13,name2,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)}Mikami Teru\N{\fs29.348}Tokyo Public Prosecutors Office\NPublic Prosecutor
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.56,0:45:06.00,Flashback,misa,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.90,0:45:11.33,Flashback,misa,0,0,0,,Papa? Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.54,0:45:22.65,Flashback,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.12,0:45:29.92,Main,misa,0,0,0,,But someone like him deserves to be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.22,0:45:32.79,Main,mikami,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.49,0:45:36.79,Main,mikami,0,0,0,,but the treatment of convicts \Nis decided fairly under the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.66,0:45:40.53,Main,misa,0,0,0,,Isn't it the law that judges the bad guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.50,0:45:45.00,Main,misa,0,0,0,,Then who is the law really protecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.04,0:45:47.27,Main,mikami,0,0,0,,It's already been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.87,0:45:49.87,Main,mikami,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.61,0:45:57.18,Main,misa,0,0,0,,Give... Give me back my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.40,0:46:16.70,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,The defendant Kyu Nishida,\Nkiller of a husband and wife in Maebashi
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.70,0:46:18.94,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,The defendant Kyu Nishida
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.37,0:46:18.37,Main,light,0,0,0,,Nishida...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.10,0:46:21.30,Main,light,0,0,0,,this is the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.38,0:46:29.18,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Quit acting surprised every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.48,0:46:33.85,Main,ann,0,0,0,,{\a6}This is a live broadcast from the \NInternational Criminal Police Organization,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.18,0:46:33.25,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Hey, something interesting is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.85,0:46:37.19,Main,ann,0,0,0,,{\a6}the ICPO, to the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.19,0:46:40.36,Main,ann,0,0,0,,{\a6}Yoshio Anderson will provide simultaneous \Ninterpretation in Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.49,0:46:49.37,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}My name is Lind L. Tailor, \Notherwise known as L.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.20,0:46:51.00,Main,light,0,0,0,,L?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.10,0:46:59.54,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}I am investigating a string of \Ndeaths among heinous criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.88,0:47:01.78,Main,ryu,0,0,0,,See? Interesting, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.51,0:47:09.45,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}I will do my utmost to hunt down Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.39,0:47:19.13,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}Kira, I have an idea of why you might \Nwant to do something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.99,0:47:18.40,Main,aisawa,0,0,0,,Should we really be broadcasting this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.40,0:47:20.03,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,The higher-ups made the \Ndecision. Nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.03,0:47:20.96,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Be quiet and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.90,0:47:30.14,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}But no matter how brutal the criminals might \Nbe, you have no right to judge people.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.63,0:47:25.30,Main,man,0,0,0,,So Kira really exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.30,0:47:26.44,Main,woman,0,0,0,,Looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.91,0:47:35.38,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}What you're doing is evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.68,0:47:37.58,desk,sign,0,0,0,,Mikami Teru
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.38,0:47:38.38,Main,man,0,0,0,,Are the police declaring war on Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.55,0:47:42.35,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}Kira, are you watching this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.29,0:47:47.52,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}How are you killing these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.96,0:47:49.19,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,He asked you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.53,0:47:55.47,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}You may be feeling like God,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.17,0:48:01.14,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}but from my perspective, you're \Njust a hopeless, stupid murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.67,0:48:04.27,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,He has no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.27,0:48:07.18,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Kira's protecting the peace, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.71,0:48:10.98,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}Stop judging the world by your yardstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.98,0:48:13.55,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,He's going there?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.85,0:48:18.49,Main,light,0,0,0,,He's just talking big because \Nthere's nothing he can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.49,0:48:21.93,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}Justice always wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.93,0:48:26.56,Main,light,0,0,0,,No it doesn't. No it doesn't, \Nthat's why Kira was born!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.36,0:48:33.20,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}Kira. I will destroy your childish plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.57,0:48:36.54,Main,light,0,0,0,,You think the police can \Ndo something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.31,0:48:39.04,Main,light,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.04,0:48:41.41,Main,light,0,0,0,,You haven't made a dent in \Nthe criminal population!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.41,0:48:47.18,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}Do you really think you're needed?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.05,0:48:52.26,Main,light,0,0,0,,It's making people happy. \NIt's saving a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.26,0:48:53.59,Main,light,0,0,0,,That's what Kira does!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.32,0:48:58.13,Main,light,0,0,0,,The things you can't do... Kira {\i1}can{\i0} do!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.43,0:49:03.43,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}Kira, I will send you to the gallows.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.13,0:49:07.94,Main,light,0,0,0,,I won't let you... I won't let you stop Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.67,0:49:12.01,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}I will hunt you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.68,0:49:23.02,Main,light,0,0,0,,Lind L. Tailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.26,0:49:32.03,Main,light,0,0,0,,Ten...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.53,0:49:35.13,Main,interpreter,0,0,0,,{\a6}Prepare yourself, Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.44,0:49:39.44,Main,light,0,0,0,,Thirty...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.91,0:49:45.84,Main,light,0,0,0,,Forty...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.43,0:50:08.67,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Great work, Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.40,0:50:10.27,Main,light,0,0,0,,It's you...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.74,0:50:15.01,Main,light,0,0,0,,It's your own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.68,0:50:20.64,Main,light,0,0,0,,Because you tried to get in Kira's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.28,0:50:27.18,Main,L,0,0,0,,{\a6}I can't believe this, Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.95,0:50:32.16,Main,L,0,0,0,,{\a6}You can kill someone without direct contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.79,0:50:35.43,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.89,0:50:38.76,Main,L,0,0,0,,{\a6}The Lind L. Tailor you saw \Non the broadcast today
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.76,0:50:41.63,Main,L,0,0,0,,{\a6}was a convict due to be executed today.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.13,0:50:45.20,Main,L,0,0,0,,{\a6}In other words, a stand-in for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.47,0:50:49.27,Main,light,0,0,0,,S-Stand in?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.41,0:50:51.17,Main,L,0,0,0,,Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.48,0:50:59.15,Main,L,0,0,0,,If you don't like it, try to kill me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.12,0:51:04.32,Main,L,0,0,0,,{\a6}Go on. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.96,0:51:06.36,Main,L,0,0,0,,{\a6}Give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.86,0:51:12.90,Main,L,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You can't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.40,0:51:18.50,Main,L,0,0,0,,{\a6}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.40,0:51:23.77,Main,L,0,0,0,,There are people you can't kill, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.77,0:51:27.74,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Oops! He's got you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.25,0:51:29.65,Main,L,0,0,0,,Oh, and one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.28,0:51:33.68,Main,L,0,0,0,,I said the broadcast was going \Nout live to the whole world,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.35,0:51:37.65,Main,L,0,0,0,,{\a6}but it's actually only being \Nbroadcast in Japan's Kanto region.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.03,0:51:46.60,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'd planned to broadcast it in other \Nregions after some time had passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.60,0:51:47.76,Main,L,0,0,0,,but there's no need for that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.27,0:51:53.44,Main,L,0,0,0,,After all, you're in Kanto, aren't you, Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.64,0:51:59.74,Main,matsuda,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.74,0:52:00.48,Main,aizawa,0,0,0,,Matsuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.48,0:52:04.61,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,Sir, L just confirmed Kira's existence {\i1}and {\i0}\Nwhere he's hiding in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.61,0:52:05.35,Main,aizawa,0,0,0,,Matsuda!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.35,0:52:06.48,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Pipe down.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.78,0:52:08.99,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,You saw that he sacrificed \Nthe life of a man to do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.99,0:52:11.32,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,even if he was scheduled to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.79,0:52:13.39,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,He's doing the same thing Kira is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.29,0:52:18.93,Main,L,0,0,0,,{\a6}But that's no reason to just give \Nup and turn yourself in, Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.46,0:52:23.87,Main,L,0,0,0,,{\a6}You're going to be found and your \Nmethod of killing exposed...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.94,0:52:26.07,Main,L,0,0,0,,{\a6}...by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.28,0:52:37.18,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,He's good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.68,0:52:40.15,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Though he doesn't know your \Nname or what you look like...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.48,0:52:42.29,Main,light,0,0,0,,L...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.85,0:52:47.32,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Well, not my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.57,0:52:57.20,Main,goda,0,0,0,,Ogiso, what is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.20,0:52:58.64,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.64,0:52:59.20,Main,goda,0,0,0,,Get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.20,0:52:59.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.91,0:53:11.48,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,I want to talk to L directly.\NPut me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.32,0:53:13.18,Main,clerk,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.02,0:53:24.49,Main,L,0,0,0,,Why couldn't Kira kill me if \Nhe could kill my stand-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.47,0:53:31.30,Main,L,0,0,0,,Faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.94,0:53:36.81,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,L, I'm Yagami from the 1st Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.24,0:53:38.68,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Can you talk now?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.68,0:53:40.01,Main,L,0,0,0,,Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.01,0:53:43.21,Main,L,0,0,0,,The victims, the press \Ncorps, and the internet...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.21,0:53:45.72,Main,L,0,0,0,,I want you to run another \Nthorough investigation
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.72,0:53:49.55,Main,L,0,0,0,,on how the men who would become \Nvictims were reported to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.55,0:53:52.22,Main,L,0,0,0,,What I want to know is—
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.22,0:53:54.29,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,There's something I want \Nto talk to you about first.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.30,0:54:01.67,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,What do you think human life is?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.43,0:54:06.30,Main,L,0,0,0,,If you're talking about my stand-in, \NI got the ICPO's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.74,0:54:08.17,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,I don't care about permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.07,0:54:11.88,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Did you think there was a chance \Nthat convict could be killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.81,0:54:16.31,Main,L,0,0,0,,I don't reveal my face and name to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.98,0:54:19.15,Main,L,0,0,0,,That's how I always do things.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.15,0:54:20.92,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Then what did you mean
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.79,0:54:24.02,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,when you said that Kira didn't \Nhave to turn himself in?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.69,0:54:32.56,Main,L,0,0,0,,It's the job of you, the police,\Nto arrest Kira, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.13,0:54:34.60,Main,man,0,0,0,,Just who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.67,0:54:38.60,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,How do you expect me to run an investigation \Nwith someone who thinks the way you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.30,0:54:40.94,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to put our \Nlives in each other's hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.81,0:54:44.74,Main,L,0,0,0,,Lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.84,0:54:49.75,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Yes. I don't think I'm exaggerating here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.95,0:54:53.55,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,We're putting our lives on the \Nline in this battle with Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.68,0:54:56.25,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,I want you to give that considerable thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.99,0:55:06.06,Main,L,0,0,0,,Then, on the point about lives on \Nthe line, I've realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.30,0:55:12.77,Main,L,0,0,0,,Kira can kill a person with \Njust their face and their name.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.21,0:55:16.74,Main,aizawa,0,0,0,,Just their face and their name?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.14,0:55:18.74,Main,man,0,0,0,,Is he serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.05,0:55:28.08,Main,L,0,0,0,,Shall I give you my profile on Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.49,0:55:31.76,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.22,0:55:34.62,Main,light,0,0,0,,Sorry, I know you're busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.06,0:55:36.39,Main,light,0,0,0,,Here, it's a change of clothes for my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.39,0:55:38.56,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,That's so nice of you. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.56,0:55:42.00,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,The Chief's been in a meeting for a while. \NHe'll probably stay again tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.40,0:55:46.14,Main,light,0,0,0,,Is this about the broadcast this afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.14,0:55:48.64,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,Did you see it? L's incredible, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.04,0:55:50.64,Main,light,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.31,0:55:55.01,Main,light,0,0,0,,What kind of person is L?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.35,0:55:59.52,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,I can't disclose much,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.52,0:56:01.69,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,but he's a great detective \Nwho's solved a bunch of cases
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.69,0:56:04.15,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,in foreign countries that hit dead \Nends, and he's a total unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.52,0:56:06.46,Main,light,0,0,0,,Unknown?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.46,0:56:09.29,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,He won't reveal his face or \Nhis name, even to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.09,0:56:15.83,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,But, well, with L's help, I'm sure the \NChief will be able to go home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.60,0:56:20.17,Main,light,0,0,0,,Does that mean... he seems \Nto know who Kira is?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.17,0:56:23.24,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,This is between us, just between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.84,0:56:26.54,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,The truth is, he's pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.05,0:56:32.35,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Kira Victims Death Time Comparison
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.08,0:56:32.35,Main,himura,0,0,0,,As L indicated, there's a pattern
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.65,0:56:37.02,Main,himura,0,0,0,,in the estimated times when people \Nbelieved to be killed by Kira died.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.55,0:56:41.19,Main,himura,0,0,0,,34% were killed between \N8:00 PM and midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.19,0:56:44.23,Main,himura,0,0,0,,42% were killed between \Nmidnight and 3:00 AM.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.66,0:56:49.23,Main,himura,0,0,0,,This late-night focus suggests a strong \Npossibility that he's a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.17,0:56:53.37,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,A student committed these murders?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.84,0:56:58.01,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,Now about the way the victims \Nwere covered in Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.01,0:57:01.11,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,they're all people we could confirm with \Nface and name on the news or the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.08,0:57:04.95,Main,L,0,0,0,,See? Just like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.25,0:57:11.52,Main,L,0,0,0,,Kira is a student living in the Kanto area
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.52,0:57:15.63,Main,L,0,0,0,,who can kill someone without direct contact, \Nas long as he knows their name and face.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.33,0:57:18.63,Main,L,0,0,0,,Or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.60,0:57:26.60,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,L is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.60,0:57:29.44,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,From the fact that Kira retaliated \Nduring the broadcast,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.44,0:57:32.31,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,he determined that he's got a strong \Nexhibitionist streak and that he's young.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.31,0:57:36.35,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,And the time frame of the crimes backed \Nup the idea that he's a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.88,0:57:40.52,Main,light,0,0,0,,The time of the crimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.76,0:57:47.66,Italics,light,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.23,0:57:49.83,Italics,light,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.60,0:57:54.70,Main,light,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.32,0:58:23.36,Main,hira,0,0,0,,The public sector has better job \Nsecurity than a corporation, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.36,0:58:25.00,Main,light,0,0,0,,Nowadays, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.05,0:58:47.25,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,The time of the crimes has changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.45,0:58:52.52,Main,mogi,0,0,0,,All the criminals who died from heart \Nattacks this week have done so during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.52,0:58:57.76,Main,aizawa,0,0,0,,Does that cast doubt on L's \Nprofile of him as a student?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.69,0:58:54.96,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,New deaths believed to be perpetrated by Kira
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.76,0:58:59.26,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,Ugh..
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.26,0:59:00.16,Main,cop,0,0,0,,Can we really trust L?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.16,0:59:02.27,Main,cop,0,0,0,,Maybe he's just jerking us around.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.27,0:59:04.63,Main,cop,0,0,0,,The Kira thing could just \Nbe a one-man show he put on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.31,0:59:13.91,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,If the cause of death is written within \N40 seconds of writing the person's name,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.91,0:59:15.55,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,it will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.55,0:59:17.31,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,After writing the cause of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.31,0:59:21.55,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,details of the death should be written \Nin the next six minutes and 40 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.95,0:59:23.55,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.55,0:59:27.36,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,You wrote 'heart attack', \Nbut set the time later.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.02,0:59:27.36,notebook-general,sign,0,0,0,,...will die of a heart attack at 11:00 AM.\N...will die of a heart attack at 4:00 PM\N...will die of a heart attack at 12:30 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.19,0:59:29.59,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.93,0:59:36.57,Main,light,0,0,0,,Hopefully, if nothing else, they'll \Nabandon the idea that Kira is a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.90,0:59:39.87,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,You managed to pull through, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.87,0:59:43.64,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,I think you'd be pretty good in battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.68,0:59:51.21,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Just what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.58,0:59:54.22,Main,goda,0,0,0,,Ogiso, can't you meet with L?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.22,0:59:56.82,Main,ogi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. L won't meet with anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.82,0:59:57.89,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'll meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.99,0:59:59.96,Main,man,0,0,0,,It's from L!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.02,1:00:01.49,Main,goda,0,0,0,,Put him on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.86,1:00:03.16,Main,man,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.36,1:00:08.06,Main,L,0,0,0,,But on have one condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.07,1:00:10.83,Main,L,0,0,0,,Yagami Soichiro-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.87,1:00:14.67,Main,L,0,0,0,,It must be you, alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.67,1:00:19.28,Main,L,0,0,0,,That's the condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.68,1:00:32.12,Main,watari,0,0,0,,That's unusual. You never \Ninvite people to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.19,1:00:36.93,Main,watari,0,0,0,,Did his scolding have an effect on you, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.36,1:00:42.43,Main,watari,0,0,0,,You like him, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.97,1:00:53.91,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Live - Spree killing suspect \Nholed up with hostages
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.97,1:00:56.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It appears that the suspect \Nhas died in the house. The hostage...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.11,1:01:02.92,Main,watari,0,0,0,,You don't meet many people who \Ncan leave you speechless.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.12,1:01:06.19,Main,L,0,0,0,,Get that list ready at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.12,1:01:08.92,Main,L,0,0,0,,Before Yagami-san arrives.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.69,1:01:12.13,Main,watari,0,0,0,,Oh, this is...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.04,1:01:24.94,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,The Legend of Kira, Our Savior\N\NMy boyfriend was killed by a slasher. \NPlease Kira, take revenge.\N The person who killed my family has been released. \NPlease purge him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.94,1:01:27.45,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,The person who killed my family has been released. \NPlease purge him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.22,1:01:35.15,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,The defendant Nishida Kyu, \Nkiller of a husband and wife in Maebashi
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.91,1:02:05.05,Main,guard,0,0,0,,Nishida, make an honest \Nliving from now on, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.36,1:02:16.73,Main,guard,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Hey, Nishida!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.73,1:02:18.83,Main,guard,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Nishida!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.04,1:02:28.24,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Died of a heart attack on the day of parole \NInmate Nishida Kyu
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.14,1:02:31.81,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Died of a heart attack on the day of parole \NInmate Nishida Kyu
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.81,1:02:33.78,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,some believe it to be the work of Kira
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.55,1:02:38.92,Main,misa,0,0,0,,Kira did this?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.49,1:02:52.03,Main,watari,0,0,0,,So sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.20,1:02:54.53,Main,watari,0,0,0,,Please step this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.96,1:03:26.13,Main,watari,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.40,1:03:37.88,Main,watari,0,0,0,,Please leave your cell phone and \Nother communications devices here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.72,1:03:50.62,Main,watari,0,0,0,,Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.73,1:04:05.54,Main,watari,0,0,0,,Your pardon. It's disinfectant.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.50,1:04:09.34,Main,watari,0,0,0,,He's a sensitive person in many ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.78,1:04:16.38,Main,watari,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.46,1:04:28.56,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,So you're...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.63,1:04:32.70,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'm L.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.00,1:04:37.13,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,I'm Yagami Soichiro of the \NCriminal Investiga—
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.13,1:04:38.44,Main,L,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.64,1:04:41.51,Main,L,0,0,0,,I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.57,1:04:45.28,Main,L,0,0,0,,No matter who you're talking to,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.28,1:04:48.31,Main,L,0,0,0,,you shouldn't reveal your name or face to \Nanyone, unless it's absolutely necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.68,1:04:57.76,Main,L,0,0,0,,If I'm Kira, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.92,1:05:01.43,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,You're not Kira.\NYou're one of our allies.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.00,1:05:08.43,Main,L,0,0,0,,Well, as for what I wanted \Nto talk to you about...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.94,1:05:14.61,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,You think someone in the case \Nheadquarters is connected to Kira?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.61,1:05:21.71,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,It's true that the day after you profiled Kira,\N the time of the killings changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.48,1:05:25.38,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,In other words, the information was leaked.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.39,1:05:30.69,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Is that why you said you'd \Nonly speak to one person?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.96,1:05:35.06,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Though I don't know why that person was me...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.53,1:05:39.86,Main,L,0,0,0,,You're the type that always ends up on \Nthe losing end of things, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.63,1:05:45.37,Main,L,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the way things are right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.64,1:05:50.41,Main,L,0,0,0,,the more trustworthy someone is,\N the more they'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.08,1:05:56.01,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,But it will be hard to pin down \Nwhere the leak is coming from.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.45,1:05:59.65,Main,L,0,0,0,,Watari, show him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.42,1:06:03.45,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.26,1:06:08.09,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'm certain that Kira is one of these.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.73,1:06:13.46,signs-general,sign,0,0,0,,Ichigo Berry
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.13,1:06:19.40,Italics,light,0,0,0,,You can invest your life in something, \Nand it might make you money,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.10,1:06:21.91,Italics,light,0,0,0,,but it won't necessarily make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.37,1:06:25.21,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Light! Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.01,1:06:27.91,Main,light,0,0,0,,Try not to talk to me outside, if possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.51,1:06:30.88,Main,light,0,0,0,,Unlike you, people can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.02,1:06:38.29,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,What I'm about to tell you \Nisn't because I'm on your side,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.29,1:06:42.16,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,but just because it creeps me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.16,1:06:45.03,Main,light,0,0,0,,What is it? Out with it already.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.57,1:06:52.14,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,I'm always close to you, so I can tell...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.14,1:06:56.01,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,there's a human who's been \Nfollowing you around lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.31,1:07:04.68,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,The FBI?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.52,1:07:09.05,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,You're having American investigators check \Nout people related to the case squad?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.05,1:07:09.89,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,Even their families?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.89,1:07:14.29,Main,L,0,0,0,,Yes. This is one thing I can't \Nask the Japanese police to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.36,1:07:20.43,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,You think that guy's working with L?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.57,1:07:26.70,Italics,light,0,0,0,,As long as I can feed myself and \Nspend my days in peace and stability,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.70,1:07:27.44,Italics,light,0,0,0,,that's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.97,1:07:30.31,Italics,light,0,0,0,,Or so I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.14,1:07:34.35,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Right, Light?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.18,1:07:39.08,Main,light,0,0,0,,I understand. This is a battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.16,1:07:45.49,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.52,1:07:47.22,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.46,1:07:52.76,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Light... Top class!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.06,1:07:59.04,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,Everyone got here early.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.04,1:08:05.24,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,Hey, I heard before, the guy who \Nkilled Misa Misa's family... he died.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.91,1:08:06.98,Main,kamo,0,0,0,,A heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.08,1:08:10.28,Main,light,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.52,1:08:18.52,Main,misa,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.52,1:08:19.82,Main,both,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.82,1:08:23.09,Main,crowd,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.09,1:08:25.93,Main,misa,0,0,0,,I have an announcement just for you guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.93,1:08:27.87,Main,crowd,0,0,0,,Yeah? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.57,1:08:30.23,Main,misa,0,0,0,,This is just between us,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.87,1:08:33.14,Main,misa,0,0,0,,but something really good happened to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.14,1:08:34.74,Main,crowd,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.74,1:08:39.04,Main,light,0,0,0,,I want this peace to \Ncontinue... that's why...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.51,1:08:40.61,Main,misa,0,0,0,,It's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.61,1:08:44.75,Main,crowd,0,0,0,,Huh? Tell us!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.75,1:08:53.66,Main,misa,0,0,0,,But thanks to someone, \Nmy heart was protected.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.76,1:08:59.76,Main,misa,0,0,0,,So today, I'm going to sing my heart out!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.61,1:09:15.21,Italics,light,0,0,0,,That's why I have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.08,1:09:18.45,Main,soichi,0,0,0,,You've gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.12,1:09:21.75,Main,L,0,0,0,,You shouldn't think of Kira as human.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.19,1:09:25.82,Main,L,0,0,0,,He's the devil.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.22,1:09:29.36,Italics,light,0,0,0,,I need to find him and eliminate him:
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.26,1:09:31.66,Italics,light,0,0,0,,L.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.63,1:09:35.90,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'm going to find him no matter what:
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.47,1:09:40.47,Main,L,0,0,0,,Kira.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.21,1:09:45.94,Italics,light,0,0,0,,Even if I can't do it, Kira can.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.58,1:09:47.28,Italics,light,0,0,0,,Kira can
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.21,1:09:51.78,Italics,light,0,0,0,,change the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.35,1:10:02.89,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,They both need to find someone whose \Nface and name they don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.89,1:10:07.06,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,And whoever gets found first...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.63,1:10:09.97,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,...will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.77,1:10:17.81,Main,ryuk,0,0,0,,Humans are just so damn interesting!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.78,1:10:30.02,Main,doll,0,0,0,,Hey, how do you think\N those jerks will turn out, Near?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.49,1:10:33.99,Main,near,0,0,0,,You shouldn't call them jerks.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.43,1:10:39.63,Main,doll,0,0,0,,It'll be worth watching. Kira and L... \Nwho's going to fall apart first?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.77,1:10:45.57,name6,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)}Near
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.82,1:11:00.22,NextEp,,0,0,0,,Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.32,1:11:00.22,NextEpTitle,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)}The Shadow that Follows {\c&H2400CB&}Light
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.45,1:11:00.22,Main,,0,0,0,,We must catch Kira.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.22,1:11:01.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go after Kira with L.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.22,1:11:03.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Your life is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.42,1:11:03.72,NextEpTitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)}The Impending End of Misa's {\c&H2400CB&}Life
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.05,1:11:03.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Kira...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.72,1:11:05.69,Main,,0,0,0,,It's gonna blow!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.69,1:11:07.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll eliminate anyone who gets in my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.69,1:11:09.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you do today?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.16,1:11:11.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You're Kira, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.50,1:11:14.03,Main,,0,0,0,,{\a6}Yagami Light...
